From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julio Fort <julio.fort@blazeinfosec.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Authenticate the viewer on every conversations handler

All four conversation handlers trusted a viewerId or email from the request
as proof of identity, so an unauthenticated caller could read private
threads, post messages attributed to a genuine participant and change
another viewer's notification setting. Resolve the viewer from the
authenticated session in every handler and reject a mismatch.
---
